CodePilot is an open-source Unity development assistant designed to enhance
workflow efficiency, improve project navigation, and provide advanced editor
tooling for Unity developers. This license governs the use, distribution, and
modification of the CodePilot software and all associated assets, scripts,
editor tools, and documentation included in this repository.

